# Why this Module ships no seed/ directory.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

RedisInsight adds the stack Redis itself, from the RI_REDIS_* environment
variables, on first start — that is the only registration this Module needs and
it is configuration, not seed. Everything else is per-user UI state in the
redisinsight-data volume.
